OL,3,AUK food supply chain affected by
OL,4,AEuropean freezer hack, cyber chief says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses in the UK's food supply
OL,7,Fchain have been impacted by the
OL,8,Fcyber-attack which hit supermarket
OL,9,Ffridges and freezers across Europe on
OL,10,FMonday.
OL,12,FThe National Cyber Security Centre
OL,13,F(NCSC) says it is aware of "a couple of
OL,14,Finstances where vulnerable technology
OL,15,Fhad been exploited in the UK."
OL,17,FThe NCSC's chief executive Dr Richard
OL,18,FHorne told the Today programme, on BBC
OL,19,FRadio Four, that it had "worked through
OL,20,Fthe night" to alert potentially
OL,21,Faffected organisations in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
